  "name": "Dark Elf Spellcasting",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All Dark Elves enjoy the protection of their patron goddess. Excepting the cantrip, you can cast the following spells once per Long Rest without expending material components. Your spellcasting ability for these spells is WIS or CHA (your choice). You can also cast them using spell slots you have of the appropriate level.</p><p>Dancing Lights, Sanctuary, Healing Spirit.</p>",
